+Actual stages: `inspect`, `backup`, `preview`, `grant-delete`, `heads`,
+`permission-probe`, `maintenance`, `snapshot`, `schema`, `check-program`,
+`catalog`, `canary`, `promote`, `smoke`, `catalog-http`, `browser`, `finish`.
